# This fixture is a miniature of the workspace it proves the cache contract for,
# and the contract is about *source* inputs: a task's hash may not move because a
# recipe wrote a log on its way in. Nx hashes untracked files that nothing ignores,
# so without this the fixture's cross-worktree hit held only while no wrapper wrote
# into the tree first — and `scripts/workspace-install.sh` writing Bun's own
# millisecond-stamped reconciliation there made the hit intermittent.
/.logs/
/.nx/
node_modules/
